{"_v":1,"id":"les-miserables-west-end-2021","bd":{"positive":5,"mixed":0,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"Dominic Cavendish","o":"The Telegraph","s":84,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.telegraph.co.uk/theatre/what-to-see/les-miserables-sondheim-theatre-review-perfect-theatre-perfect/","d":"2020-01-16","q":"Old-fashioned though it may seem in contrast, in its density and epic ambition, its mixture of high-powered ideas and gut-wrenching emotions, it’s a show that feels lastingly revolutionary."},{"cn":"Nick Curtis","o":"Evening Standard","s":81,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.standard.co.uk/culture/theatre/les-miserables-review-revamped-musical-opens-at-londons-sondheim-theatre-with-added-grit-a4336836.html","d":"2020-01-17","q":"All in all, Les Mis and the refurbished Sondheim feel fit for purpose for the next decade or three."},{"cn":"Clive Davis","o":"The Times (UK)","s":45,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.thetimes.co.uk/article/les-miserables-review-overlong-and-clunky-but-there-was-much-to-admire-in-the-performances-r6w7lmhj5","d":"2020-01-17","q":"[Les Miserables] remains grossly melodramatic, overlong and overloud."},{"cn":"Mark Shenton","o":"London Theatre","s":93,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.londontheatre.co.uk/reviews/review-les-miserables-at-the-sondheim-theatre","d":"2020-01-17","q":"The show remains a thrilling triumph."},{"cn":"Sarah Crompton","o":"WhatsOnStage","s":72,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.whatsonstage.com/london-theatre/reviews/les-miserables-sondheim-west-end-2020_50720.html","d":"2020-01-17","q":"People love Les Mis with a passion and I can see why."},{"cn":"Aleks Sierz","o":"The Arts Desk","s":75,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://theartsdesk.com/theatre/les-mis%C3%A9rables-sondheim-theatre-review-join-our-crusade","d":"2020-01-17","q":"It barely needs to be said that the picture that [Les Miserables] paints of the poor echoes sights you can see in the streets every day, and so there is little point in denying its political punch."}],"au":{"score":91,"designation":"Loving","sources":{"mz":{"s":91,"c":5790,"sr":4.6}}},"hi":"https://images.ctfassets.net/6pezt69ih962/1HWGiuYu6quklhSqWs0s6b/8f8d504bec13902aaef4f91524a20af9/MIS_Updated-Ticket-Agent_1440x580_AW.jpg?fm=webp&q=90"}